## Typography

### Headings

- **Page Title**: `h1 capitalize sidebar-gradient-text`
- **Section Title**: `text-xl font-semibold sidebar-gradient-text`
- **Card Title**: `h5 sidebar-gradient-text` (every card title, see "Card titles (hard rule)")
- **Stat Value**: `text-3xl font-bold text-slate-700`

### Body Text

- **Primary**: `text-slate-700`
- **Secondary**: `text-slate-600`
- **Muted**: `text-slate-500`
- **Small**: `text-xs text-slate-600`

### Font family

- **App UI font**: Poppins (`font-poppins` on `<body>` in `src/app/layout.tsx`) — inherit it on all pages and components
- **Do not use** `font-mono` in app UI; use Poppins (default) for ticket numbers, IDs, and metrics too
- **Numeric columns/meters**: `tabular-nums` for aligned digits without switching font

